# Build artifacts — reproducible via build-clibs.sh / build-web.sh and the roadmap pipeline
vendor/
build/
tmp/
*.wasm
*.data

# The browser runtime under dist/ (perl-web.js/.wasm/.data) is NOT committed: it is fetched
# from the "engine-v1" GitHub Release by fetch-dist.sh (checksum-pinned; see README.md). We
# still track dist/ itself for the small harness.html + package.json, so re-include the dir
# (the repo-root .gitignore excludes every dist/) but keep the three runtime blobs ignored.
!dist/
dist/perl-web.js
